  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Tiempo**",
      "",
      "| Preposición | Se usa con | Ejemplos |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| **at** | horas y momentos | at six o'clock · at night · at the weekend |",
      "| **on** | días y fechas | on Friday · on 5 May · on Saturday morning |",
      "| **in** | meses, años, estaciones, partes del día | in July · in 2024 · in summer · in the morning |",
      "",
      "**Movimiento**",
      "",
      "- **to** → destino: *We went to the beach. We flew to Madrid.*",
      "- **from … to …** → de… a…: *from London to Paris*",
      "- **through** (a través de) · **along** (a lo largo de) · **across** (cruzando)",
      "",
      "**Medio de transporte:** **by** + transporte: *by train, by bus, by plane* · *on foot* (a pie).",
      "",
      "**Lugar:** *at the airport* · *in Madrid* · *on the train / bus / plane*.",
      "",
      "Ojo: no se usa preposición con *last / next / this / every*: *last Friday*, no *in last Friday*."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "I'll see you in Monday.",
        "right": "I'll see you on Monday.",
        "note": "Con días se usa on."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I go to work with bus.",
        "right": "I go to work by bus.",
        "note": "Transporte: by."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
